{
    "word": "gesticulation",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "008ea3ac-67a5-335c-bbfa-040ec5ecc4fe",
                "word": "gesticulation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d9e83135-a357-4fc2-a717-1c7870d756ba",
                        "entry_id": "008ea3ac-67a5-335c-bbfa-040ec5ecc4fe",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "gesticulations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a04c106c-8c8f-3a0e-aeb5-cf29601ef52f",
                        "entry_id": "008ea3ac-67a5-335c-bbfa-040ec5ecc4fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of gesticulating, or making gestures to aid expression of thoughts, sentiments or passion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dcb07f18-556f-315a-842a-b38bf4393bc5",
                        "entry_id": "008ea3ac-67a5-335c-bbfa-040ec5ecc4fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A gesture; a motion of the body or limbs when speaking, or in representing action or passion, and enforcing arguments and sentiments."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c02e7a2d-bc3d-4b33-ab48-56a27b866658",
                                "sense_id": "dcb07f18-556f-315a-842a-b38bf4393bc5",
                                "text": "In the eagerness of his gesticulations, first he knocked off my hat, then he knocked off Lessingham’s, then his own, then all three together […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2ffa030-0895-4234-9e66-cadcdce4484c",
                                "sense_id": "dcb07f18-556f-315a-842a-b38bf4393bc5",
                                "text": "It is commonly supposed that they communicated by sounds and tentacular gesticulations; this is asserted, for instance, in the able but hastily compiled pamphlet (written evidently by someone not an eye-witness of Martian actions) to which I have already alluded, and which, so far, has been the chief source of information concerning them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e196b8de-cd46-4e98-8630-afc62f0c8e0f",
                                "sense_id": "dcb07f18-556f-315a-842a-b38bf4393bc5",
                                "text": "The breeze had died away and the tree was now quite motionless save when William's statements required forcible gesticulations, which made it sway in a gentle nodding manner as though it were confirming every word the old sage uttered."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "33d75b95-7c14-3fcd-b295-dcb202c4236d",
                        "entry_id": "008ea3ac-67a5-335c-bbfa-040ec5ecc4fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An odd or fanciful motion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "dated",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb325ccc-9c84-4585-96c7-35a2ac5b578a",
                                "sense_id": "33d75b95-7c14-3fcd-b295-dcb202c4236d",
                                "text": "I indulged in this meditation for a moment, and then again addressed the mourner, who stood leaning against the bed with that expression of resigned despair, of complete misery, and a patient sufferance of it, which is far more touching than any of the insane ravings or wild gesticulation of untamed sorrow."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "04bb07ee-ff36-4911-acff-309bf3af6798",
                        "source_entry_id": "008ea3ac-67a5-335c-bbfa-040ec5ecc4fe",
                        "source_sense_description": "act of gesticulating",
                        "target_lang_word": "gesticulation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gesticulation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe11d032-d060-36f0-a06a-d2ee7c45bec8",
                                        "entry_id": "df10d787-95ca-333d-9d5b-358755c0f8a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de gesticuler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0e592f1-4736-4dff-a985-591082473251",
                                                "sense_id": "fe11d032-d060-36f0-a06a-d2ee7c45bec8",
                                                "text": "Et c’était un brouhaha grandissant, de sourdes et violentes conversations, des exclamations, des rires, au milieu d’une gesticulation passionnée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b940110-3f2e-4898-bb1e-07d4ea851baf",
                                                "sense_id": "fe11d032-d060-36f0-a06a-d2ee7c45bec8",
                                                "text": "Toutes les religions et toutes les morales ont tendu à jeter un voile sur la gesticulation fornicatoire qui est, cependant, à la base de la vie et se définit, en dernière analyse, que comme une opération d'assouvissement et de soulagement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16dddb9c-3658-457b-8e22-c5bbc2259956",
                                                "sense_id": "fe11d032-d060-36f0-a06a-d2ee7c45bec8",
                                                "text": "Mais je le confesse : après la colère passée, j’ai surtout eu pitié de ces pauvres bougres et j’ai vu dans leurs gesticulations bien moins d’insouciance que de désespoir."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7361f54-5a22-342d-bbff-120d692b0eac",
                                        "entry_id": "df10d787-95ca-333d-9d5b-358755c0f8a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fait de montrer ses forces sans les utiliser dans un but d’intimidation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab14c09e-619d-4ecc-8307-9871f1888a56",
                                                "sense_id": "e7361f54-5a22-342d-bbff-120d692b0eac",
                                                "text": "Le pouvoir de Bachar al-Assad n’est en rien ébranlé. Russes et Iraniens demeurent les maîtres du jeu et de l’hypothétique solution diplomatique à venir. Alors à quoi sert cette modeste intervention militaire ? Était-il nécessaire que Donald Trump, Theresa May et Emmanuel Macron entreprennent une telle gesticulation ? Oui, pour au moins quatre raisons."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69b5e5a6-53e8-4698-9618-0a95a6e49f3b",
                        "source_entry_id": "008ea3ac-67a5-335c-bbfa-040ec5ecc4fe",
                        "source_sense_description": "act of gesticulating",
